get-cpcert-rs authors
=====================

Original C implementation (get-cpcert):
  Sergey Kovalev <kov-serg@github>
  https://github.com/kov-serg/get-cpcert
  Copyright (c) 2019, licensed under GPL-2.0

Rust port (get-cpcert-rs):
  metron8 <https://github.com/metron8>
  Copyright (c) 2026, licensed under GPL-2.0-or-later

The Rust port is an independent re-implementation of the same algorithm —
all source code is written from scratch in Rust. No code is copied verbatim
from the original C utility; only the cryptographic protocol (CryptoPro
KDF, GOST 28147-89 with CryptoPro/TC26 S-boxes, GOST R 34.10 elliptic
curve operations, PKCS#8 templating) is reproduced, as that is the
specification, not the code.
